### UTIG-format documentation (formerly public web)

The following PDFs were originally distributed by UTIG from:

**http://www-udc.ig.utexas.edu/external/yosio/Viking/**

That site is no longer available (content disappeared after the responsible investigator retired). The two authors (Yosio Nakamura, Lisa Gahagan) are retired and could not be reached to confirm redistribution rights; no copy of this material exists elsewhere online (Wayback Machine has no capture of the original URL prefix). Copies are bundled here **for scholarly reproducibility** of the SEISF decode, as orphan-work archival material with no identifiable commercial market, not as a claim of exclusive ownership. Contact the maintainers if a rights holder requests removal or replacement with a citation-only pointer.

