## N51SUB listing photograph

`materials/N51SUB.jpg` was **not** published on the UTIG web site above.

It is a photograph taken by Yukio Yamamoto of a paper copy of the N51SUB assembly listing that he held from a past visit to UTIG. Included only to document ground-software structure (SEISDT / UNSCR / BOUT) used in deriving the production unscramble.

## Cassette data (not redistributed)

UTIG `vkg.*` 8 mm cassette images are **not** shipped in this repository. Place them locally under `utig/` for tests, under the terms of the original archive.
